  "id": "bb-donor-eligibility-criteria",
  "title": "Whole-Blood Donor Eligibility: 13 for Him, 12.5 for Her",
  "summary": "Apply the US FDA donor eligibility minimums — sex-specific hemoglobin and hematocrit, vital-sign limits, weight, sampling rules and donation intervals — and know where autologous donors and physician exceptions differ.",
  "domain": "p5-bb",
  "topic": "ch42",
