      "altText": "Trap card: “12.5 g/dL is the minimum for every donor” is crossed out → “Male allogeneic donors need ≥ 13.0 g/dL (Hct ≥ 39%).” Trap card: “An earlobe stick is fine for hemoglobin screening” is crossed out → “Earlobe blood is not acceptable.” Trap card: “Double red cells can be given every 8 weeks” is crossed out → “Two-unit apheresis red cells: once in 16 weeks.”",
