          "text": "Trap one: twelve point five isn’t the minimum for everyone. Male allogeneic donors need thirteen point zero."
        },
        {
          "id": "e2",
          "start": 154,
          "end": 164,
          "text": "Trap two: earlobe blood isn’t acceptable for donor hemoglobin screening."
        },
        {
          "id": "e3",
